.planning/260729_csk-rc5-conformance-consumer-design.md:149:The two framed preimages are also fully recoverable in pure Python — a one-byte record tag (`D` directory, `F` file, `L` symlink, `V` version) followed by uint64 **big-endian** path length, path, uint64 big-endian payload length, payload, after a `curator-build-source-v1\0` / `curator-go-toolchain-v1\0` domain prefix. Decoding the published preimage is enough to specify the writer; **no Go source needs to be read or copied**, which satisfies the independence requirement in §6.2/§6.3 of the accepted parity map.
