+# TASK-260720-3c0ss2 — Build-source identity and context isolation
+
+## Candidate identity
+
+- Repository: `/Users/iv/Developer/Wildberries/cocoaskills`
+- Fast-forwarded clean base: `dd76b570f88339fd1d659c02950e68b17f6ba834`
